# Context-root ignore for the gateway/demo/all/ui/sidecar image builds, which
# CI runs with `context: ./src`. Buildkit reads the .dockerignore from the
# context root, so it must live here (not just under Stylobot.Gateway/).
# Without this, a working tree that has run `npm install` leaks
# Mostlylucid.BotDetection.UI/node_modules into the build context and the
# UI project's BuildTailwindCSS target fires `npx` inside the Node-less Alpine
# SDK image (exit 127). Dropping node_modules makes the target's
# Exists('node_modules') condition false, so the committed tailwind.min.css is
# used instead. Also keeps host bin/obj out so stale artifacts can't contaminate
# the in-container restore/publish.
**/.git
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/Thumbs.db
**/.DS_Store
**/logs
**/data